description: Retrieves a list of available endpoint scripts available in CORTEX based
  on specified filter criteria such as the script's name or its supported operating
  system. This action returns essential details for each script, including its Globally
  Unique Identifier (UID), which is required for other script-related actions.
display: Cortex - List Endpoint Scripts
